    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "私服の方が撮影としては良い、とか\r\nあったりする？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもレッスンで使っているジャージで大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他の事務所の方々と話した時に\r\n事務所統一のジャージや運動着にするって話をしてあるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "撮影スタッフはもちろん、参加者同士も\r\nそれぞれどの事務所の誰なのか判別しやすいだろうから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "確かに、初めて会う人が多いもんね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "チア練習の日も同じ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その予定だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わかった！　忘れないうちにメモしておく！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "チアの練習、\r\nポンポンで踊ったりするのかなぁ、楽しみ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "組体操みたいなパターンもあるけど\r\nどうなんだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かイメージ資料はこの辺に……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "1588"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プログラムの\r\nパフォーマンスの部分だから……",
