    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、さっそく応援されちゃったかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "へ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、めぐる\r\nめぐるが練習に集中できるように、全力を尽くすよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2800
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスンの量や時間は調整するけど、\r\nやっぱり普段よりも体力を使うことになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普段なら大丈夫だったのに、疲れが出て……\r\nってこともあるから。気を付けような",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろん！\r\nそれで動けなくなっちゃったら本末転倒だもん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003022010260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、でもでも\r\n楽しくなっちゃって時間を忘れちゃったときは……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200302201/2003022010260"
  },
  {
